              "content": "Max content width: 1200px (centered)\nPage horizontal padding: 24–32px\nSection gap: 32px\nCard gap: 24px (grid), 16px (internal)\nFilter bar height: ~56px\nNavbar height: 64px\n\nGrid: 3-column (desktop), 2-column (tablet), 1-column (mobile)\nMap split: 55% map / 45% list panel\n\nBreakpoints:\n  Desktop: ≥1024px — full layout\n  Tablet: 768–1023px — 2-col grid, filters collapse\n  Mobile: <768px — 1-col, bottom sheet filters, stacked layout",
